And this is the architecture of
the model in very simple terms.

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:07.767
So the model is connected to my
email inbox and to some job boards.

00:02:08.473 --> 00:02:14.340
I actually should give you a bit of context
on what these specific workflows are

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:18.320
doing so that you understand in which type
