00:03:18.293 --> 00:03:22.987
So in order to save tokens, it skips
things in order to solve, like in terms of

00:03:23.047 --> 00:03:24.367
emails. So there's a memory.

00:03:24.767 --> 00:03:25.907
I'll talk about that later.

